      "html": "<ul><li>The 1998 Regulations list the fields every gas safety record must hold.</li><li>A missing field makes the CP12 non-compliant, however good the check.</li><li>Landlords must give tenants a copy within 28 days and keep records for 2 years.</li><li>Issue a CP12 even if an appliance is unsafe. The record shows the finding.</li><li>The HSE can prosecute a landlord with no valid record, even if nothing went wrong.</li></ul>"
